  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. <br>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.<br>• Cook sweet potato noodles over medium-high <br>heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, <br>until tender, 4-6 minutes.<br>• Drain, rinse and drizzle with olive oil.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-f5fa0000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.<br>• Roughly chop Asian greens.<br>• Thinly slice flat mushrooms (see ingredients) and <br>long chilli (if using).<br>• Finely chop garlic. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-930bf010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Using your hands, crumble firm tofu <br>(see ingredients) into small chunks.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine tofu, Asian BBQ <br>seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-59db6720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat.<br>• Add tofu and cook, tossing, until golden,  <br>4-5 minutes.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then stir in half the soy <br>sauce mix and a splash of water until well coated. <br>Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-9e8e0130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out frying pan, then return to high heat with a <br>drizzle of olive oil. <br>• Cook mushrooms until just softened, 2-3 minutes.<br>• Add carrot and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, then add Asian greens and <br>garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.<br>• Add cooked noodles, hoisin sauce, remaining soy <br>sauce mix, the vinegar and a good splash of water.<br>• Toss to combine and season to taste with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-a025f540.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide glass noodles between bowls.<br>• Top with Chinese BBQ crumbled tofu. <br>• Sprinkle with chilli to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cbdd3cd318353e2a9c03/step-c24e1350.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
